<p th:unless="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行错误的重写finalize()。" th:remove="tag"></p>]]></DynamicDescription>
			<Description><![CDATA[程序中重写的`finalize()`方法没有调用`super.finalize()`。
]]></Description>
			<Advice><![CDATA[在重写的`finalize()`方法时应调用`super.finalize()`。
]]></Advice>
			<References>
				<Reference type="CWE">568:finalize() Method Without super.finalize()</Reference>
				<Reference type="CERT">MET12-J:Do not use finalizers</Reference>
				<Reference type="SJ/T 11683-2017">6.6.17 finalize方法未调用父类的finalize方法</Reference>
			</References>
